      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "A92F72271EE738C0",
      "text": "¡Qué lástima! ¡Has estado muy cerca de la\\nrespuesta correcta!\\c\\nLa probabilidad es del 4 % aproximadamente.\\nApréndetelo bien, ¿vale?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "62D79A7982E53B46",
      "text": "¡En efecto! ¡Muy bien, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\c\\nVeo que te has quedado con todo lo que\\nestudiamos.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "A92F73271EE73A73",
      "text": "Verás... Lo cierto es que ando algo preocupada\\npor los alumnos de la Academia Arándano...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "A92F78271EE742F2",
      "text": "Prácticamente todo su temario está formado por\\nasignaturas de combate Pokémon o similares...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "A92F79271EE744A5",
      "text": "Y eso está muy bien para los que busquen\\nganarse la vida de esa forma y lo consigan.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "A92F76271EE73F8C",
      "text": "¿Pero qué pasa con todas las demás criaturas?\\n¿Aquellas que nunca verán sus sueños cumplidos?\\c\\nHay que darles más oportunidades y no cerrarles\\npuertas de cara al mañana.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 171,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "A92F77271EE7413F",
      "text": "Materias como Matemáticas, Hogar o Lingüística\\npueden ayudarles a asegurarse un futuro.\\c\\nUno nunca sabe lo que le esperará en esta vida.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "A92F7C271EE749BE",
      "text": "Soy de la opinión de que el saber nunca está\\nde más, pero...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_09",
      "hash64": "A92F7D271EE74B71",
      "text": "Ay, discúlpame. No pretendía aburrirte con mi\\nsermón...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "7E297B3B191EDCA7",
      "text": "¡No pasa nada!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_05",
      "hash64": "7E297A3B191EDAF4",
      "text": "¡Es interesante!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_10",
      "hash64": "A932FA271EEA55AF",
      "text": "Ay, gracias, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Eres un cielo.\\n¿Te lo habían dicho alguna vez?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "7D958A20BDDA2EB7",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Hola, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Gracias por escucharme\\nla otra vez.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "7D958920BDDA2D04",
      "text": "Justo después de hablar contigo, ¡me fui a ver al\\ndirector y le di mi más sincera opinión del tema!\\c\\nLe comenté que no estaría de más enseñar algo\\nmás que asignaturas de combate Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 188,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "CF14DDD21EF44623",
      "text": "¿Y qué tal fue?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "CF14DED21EF447D6",
      "text": "¡Buen trabajo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "7D958C20BDDA321D",
      "text": "Me comentó que las asignaturas obligatorias no\\npodían cambiarlas, pero que revisar las optativas\\r\\nno supondría ningún problema.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "7D958B20BDDA306A",
      "text": "De hecho, también dijo que, en parte, es por eso\\npor lo que ha puesto en marcha esta iniciativa de\\r\\ntraer a diversos invitados especiales.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
